@startuml
title UML state machines - retained instruction state and financial finality
state "Exact action review" as Review {
 [*] --> Reviewed : retain full terms + digest
 Reviewed --> Approved : matching fresh issuer proof
 Reviewed --> Expired : native expiry
 Approved --> Executed : original key / current ownership / atomic receipt
 Approved --> Expired : execution deadline
 Executed --> Executed : same original key returns receipt
}
state "Synthetic order" as Trade {
 [*] --> Open : exact approved instruction + native reservation
 Open --> Filled : approved price bound + native cash/share effect + fill receipt
 Open --> Cancelled : owner cancels original open reservation
 Open --> OrderExpired : due UTC expiry releases original reservation
 Filled --> [*]
 Cancelled --> [*]
 OrderExpired --> [*]
}
state "Recurring mandate" as Schedule {
 [*] --> Active : exact current retained consent
 Active --> Paused : owner pauses
 Paused --> Active : current UTC date; no paused-date catch-up
 Active --> ScheduleCancelled : owner cancels
 Paused --> ScheduleCancelled : owner cancels
 Active --> Active : unique schedule/date run + native receipt + advance
 Active --> Active : safe failure code + bounded retry; no fabricated completion
 Active --> Replaced : fresh approved revision of unchanged reviewed basis
 Paused --> Replaced : fresh approved revision; new version stays paused
 Replaced --> [*] : original consent/runs retained; family continues in new version
 ScheduleCancelled --> [*]
}
note right of Replaced
One family/date effect across all versions.
A run after review invalidates the revision.
end note
state "Shared withdrawal" as Group {
 [*] --> Pending : current member + unlocked vault + original native hold
 Pending --> Pending : one current member approves
 Pending --> Posted : all active members approve + payout owner rechecked
 Pending --> GroupCancelled : requester cancels original hold
 Posted --> [*]
 GroupCancelled --> [*]
}
note right of Filled
A placed order is not a financial fill.
Only native cash/share evidence establishes FILLED.
end note
note right of Executed
A new request key cannot reuse a completed approval.
Changing input under an original key is refused.
end note
@enduml
